    "Description": "A transparency slide showing the right side of a freshly painted carousel pig that is suspended on a pole with a white backdrop. The pig ranges in color from dark brown to almost white at the hooves. The saddle is light brown with a black and yellow border. The saddle blanket is black with yellow details. The tack is red with yellow clasps and the saddle strap is blue with yellow and darker blue details. The image has some black spots. The eyes of the pig are unfinished. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK 16B RR” at the top and “SEP81A5 RALEIGH NC WAKE CO 9-9-81\" at the bottom.",
